      "teaching": [\par
        "The early stage of marriage is filled with excitement and discovery, as well as significant adjustments to sharing life.",\par
        "Coordinating daily routines, shared finances, sleep schedules, and communication styles reveals differences between partners.",\par
        "Healthy marriages require intentional effort to understand each other's personalities and emotional needs beyond initial romantic feelings.",\par
        "Approaching early adjustments with patience helps couples build a resilient foundation of trust and respect for the future.",\par
        "Establishing positive habits early\f1\emdash such as regular communication and shared decision-making\emdash shapes the long-term tone of the marriage."\par
      ],\par
      "illustration": [],\par
      "reflectionQuestions": [\par
        "What lessons did you learn during the early stages of your marriage?"\par
      ],\par
