      "challenge": "The early years of marriage provide the foundation upon which future seasons will be built.",\par
      "prayer": "Father, help couples in the early stages of marriage build a strong foundation of love, wisdom, and understanding. Amen."\par
    \},\par
    \{\par
      "date": "October 30, 2026",\par
      "title": "Adjusting to Life Together",\par
      "scripture": "Philippians 2:4",\par
      "teaching": [\par
        "Transitioning from individual decision-making to a unified partnership requires emotional maturity and mutual respect.",\par
        "Couples frequently uncover contrasting communication styles, conflict resolution approaches, or financial priorities.",\par
        "Approaching personality differences with curiosity rather than criticism transforms potential frustrations into growth opportunities.",\par
        "Adjusting successfully involves mastering compromise without abandoning personal values, establishing healthy relational rhythms.",\par
        "Practicing flexibility and shared decision-making gradually builds lasting stability and mutual understanding."\par
