      ],\par
      "reflectionQuestions": [\par
        "Am I prepared to love beyond physical changes?",\par
        "Do I value companionship deeply?",\par
        "Are we building something that will endure time?"\par
      ],\par
      "practicalApplication": "Spend time today quietly sitting or walking with your spouse, appreciating their presence and lifetime of companionship.",\par
      "challenge": "Build a love that will outlive physical strength; let your marriage become a place of peace, not pressure, as time goes on.",\par
      "prayer": "Lord, help us to age with grace and love. Remove every fear associated with change, strengthen our companionship, and help us remain committed in every season. Amen."\par
    \},\par
    \{\par
      "date": "November 10, 2026",\par
      "title": "The Beauty of Long-Term Commitment",\par
      "scripture": "Hebrews 13:4",\par
      "teaching": [\par
        "Long-term marital commitment provides essential relational stability by removing premature or easy exit options.",\par
        "When leaving is not an option, couples shift their focus toward working through challenges rather than escaping them.",\par
        "Unwavering commitment yields deep trust, strength of character, and enduring emotional security over time.",\par
        "Committed couples face the same hardships as others, but navigate them with a settled mindset focused on shared growth.",\par
        "A marriage anchored in lifelong commitment matures into a transformational testimony of enduring love."\par
      ],\par
      "illustration": [\par
